  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Tour Bite is a firm, high-performance shaped co-polyester designed to maximize spin, ball bite, power and durability. Its high-powered monofilament construction and aggressive shaped geometry create exceptional rotation and spin-based control, allowing hard hitters to generate a heavy ball while maintaining directional precision. With seven gauges ranging from 1.05 to 1.35 mm, Tour Bite covers everything from extreme spin and feel to maximum durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Solinco Tour Bite 是一款偏硬、强调高性能的异形共聚酯球线，核心优势是极高旋转、强咬球、力量以及耐久性。其高性能单丝结构与侵略性异形截面能够制造大量旋转，通过旋转本身提升控制，让大力量球员打出更重、更有压迫感的球。产品提供从 1.05 到 1.35 毫米共七种线径，细线径强调极致旋转和手感，粗线径则更偏向耐久、稳定和长期比赛使用。"
  },

